# BLACK VECTOR — Runtime Data Layout

This directory documents runtime data structure.
Actual data lives in `user://` at runtime (mobile: Android app storage).

## user:// layout (runtime)

```
user://saves/slice/
  slot_00.save    — LIVING SAVE manifest (JSON, schema v1)
  slot_01.save
  ...

user://settings/
  slice_settings.cfg  — ConfigFile: input profile, camera, overlays
```

## save schema v1

```json
{
  "manifest": "black_vector_slice_living_save",
  "schema": 1,
  "seed": 42,
  "clock": 8.0,
  "world": {
    "seed": 42,
    "time": "DAWN",
    "weather": "CLEAR",
    "facility": "DORMANT",
    "aftermath": "NONE",
    "wildlife": "QUIET"
  },
  "player": {
    "seed": 42,
    "position": [0, 1, 0],
    "checkpoint": [0, 1, 0],
    "body": {
      "CORE_TEMP": 1.0,
      "CONDITION": 1.0,
      "EXERTION": 0.0,
      "WETNESS": 0.0,
      "FATIGUE": 0.0
    }
  }
}
```

Writer: `scripts/slice/save_state_manager.gd` (single writer).
Settings: `scripts/slice/settings_store.gd` (own domain, settings-save).
